sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant EnvoyGW as Envoy Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant PreProc as payload-pre-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Auth as Kuadrant/RHCL Auth<br/>(Envoy filter)
    participant PostProc as payload-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Upstream as KServe/Model Upstream

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: Pre-Auth Body-Based Routing (BBR)

    Client->>EnvoyGW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / API Key
    EnvoyGW->>PreProc: ExtProc RequestHeaders<br/>gRPC H2, TLS (self-signed, ACCEPT_UNTRUSTED)
    PreProc-->>EnvoyGW: HeaderMutation (no action yet)
    EnvoyGW->>PreProc: ExtProc RequestBody (BUFFERED)<br/>{"model": "gpt-4", ...}
    Note over PreProc: model_to_header: extracts model name<br/>llmisvc_model_provider_resolver:<br/>resolves provider
    PreProc-->>EnvoyGW: HeaderMutation<br/>+x-model-name: gpt-4<br/>+x-provider: provider-1
    Note over EnvoyGW: Pre-auth: failure_mode_allow=true (fail-open)

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 2: Authentication

    EnvoyGW->>Auth: Forward (in-process filter)
    Auth-->>EnvoyGW: Auth decision (pass/reject)

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 3: Post-Auth Request/Response Processing (IPP)

    EnvoyGW->>PostProc: ExtProc RequestHeaders<br/>gRPC H2, TLS (self-signed, ACCEPT_UNTRUSTED)
    PostProc-->>EnvoyGW: HeaderMutation
    EnvoyGW->>PostProc: ExtProc RequestBody (BUFFERED)
    Note over PostProc: IPP pipeline processes request<br/>Body accumulation ≤ 10 MiB
    PostProc-->>EnvoyGW: BodyMutation / HeaderMutation
    Note over EnvoyGW: Post-auth: failure_mode_allow=false (fail-closed)

    EnvoyGW->>Upstream: Forward to model service
    Upstream-->>EnvoyGW: Response

    EnvoyGW->>PostProc: ExtProc ResponseHeaders
    PostProc-->>EnvoyGW: HeaderMutation
    EnvoyGW->>PostProc: ExtProc ResponseBody
    Note over PostProc: Response body chunking<br/>62 KiB chunks (BODY_CHUNK_LIMIT)
    PostProc-->>EnvoyGW: BodyMutation (chunked)
    EnvoyGW-->>Client: HTTP Response

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 4: Kubernetes API Access

    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    PostProc->>KubeAPI: GET ExternalProviders, ExternalModels<br/>HTTPS, ServiceAccount token
    KubeAPI-->>PostProc: CRD resources
